  "description": "The dominator of the North who returned after conquering the war, Fernan Kaisar. \n\nA man perfect in every way, and the only person who remained a good memory in Yulia’s unhappy childhood. When she heard that he would become her husband, Yulia believed in the existence of God for the first time. However... \n\n *\"Do as you wish if there’s something you want. Whether it’s remodeling the castle, buying jewels, or throwing parties, I don’t care. Just spare me scenes like this. I don’t want to run into you in the morning.\"*",
